!!! oculus/scene-node.mat
!!! A single node in the semantic scene.
!!!
!!! A scene node is the atomic unit of the desktop model: it carries
!!! its identity, role, position, size, focus state, label, and parent
!!! reference. Every window, region, control, heading, status and panel
!!! in the scene is one of these.

book oculus.scene.node

read everything from ny.lang.core
read everything from oculus.window.identity
read everything from oculus.window.role
read everything from oculus.window.focus
read everything from oculus.window.geometry

public scene-node begin record
    field identity as override long
    field role as window-role
    field geometry as rectangle
    field focus as focus-position
    field label as text
    field parent-identity as override long
end record
